   "title": "Wave Beam In-Ear Wireless Earbuds",
   "description": "The JBL Wave Beam In-Ear Wireless Earbuds are designed for daily entertainment, featuring JBL Deep Bass Sound via 8mm drivers. They offer a secure, comfortable stick-closed ergonomic design that excludes external sounds to enhance bass performance. These earbuds are splash and dust resistant and provide up to 32 total hours of battery life (8 hours in the earbuds and 24 hours in the charging case), with a speed charge capability that provides two additional hours of power in just 10 minutes. Additionally, they feature Smart Ambient technology for situational awareness and crystal-clear hands-free stereo calls.",
